 can join the CDF. They don''t want young people; they want people who carry the knowledge and skills of decades of living. Old Man''s War John Perry did two things on his 75th birthday. First he visited his wife''s grave. Then he joined the army, with only the vaguest idea what to expect. Because the actual fight is far more difficult than he can imagine--and what he will become is far stranger. The Ghost Brigades At first, Jared is a perfect soldier, but as another man''s memories slowly surface, Jared begins to intuit the reasons for their betrayal. Time is running out: The alliance is preparing its offensive, and some of them plan worse things than humanity''s mere military defeat. The Last Colony Retired from his fighting days, John Perry and his wife, Jane, are pulled back into the political arena, and into the thick of interstellar politics, betrayal, and war. Old Man''s War Series #1 Old Man''s War #2 The Ghost Brigades #3 The Last Colony #4 Zoe''s Tale #5 The Human Division #6 The End of All Things Short fiction: \"After the Coup\"", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=qdKMEQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=1&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2014-08-26", "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Old_Man_s_War_Boxed_Set_I.html?hl=&id=qdKMEQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9780765379382"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "0765379384"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "lKHW_5W0bKkC", "etag": "I0r2oV1+qpM", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 5990000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 5990000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC&rdid=book-lKHW_5W0bKkC&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 5.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 5.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/lKHW_5W0bKkC", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "But in return, its Colonial Defence Force demands two years of hazardous service in space. This is how Perry finds himself in a new body, crafted from his original DNA. A genetically enhanced and upgraded new body, ready for battle."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Old Man''s War", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "Military Science Fiction Adventure", "pageCount": 321, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Pan Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "At seventy-five years old, John Perry is looking for a fresh start – in the army. But the universe is a dangerous place in John Scalzi''s Old Man''s War . . . ''Gripping and surpassingly original'' – Cory Doctorow, author of Walkaway Earth''s military machine can transform elderly recruits, restoring their lost youth. But in return, its Colonial Defence Force demands two years of hazardous service in space. This is how Perry finds himself in a new body, crafted from his original DNA. A genetically enhanced and upgraded new body, ready for battle. But upgrades alone won''t keep Perry safe. He''ll be fighting for his life on the front line as he defends humanity''s colonies from hostile aliens. He''ll pay the price for his choices. And he''ll discover the universe is even more dangerous than he imagined . . . ''A space war story with fast action, vivid characters, moral complexity, and cool speculative physics'' – Ken MacLeod, author of Beyond the Light Horizon Old Man''s War is the first in the series. The gripping space war continues with The Ghost Brigades.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=2&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2011-02-04", "contentVersion": "5.16.15.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=lKHW_5W0bKkC", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9780330538169"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "0330538160"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "Idz60QEACAAJ", "etag": "5qglkp79Vg0", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/Idz60QEACAAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=Idz60QEACAAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Old Man''s War Series: 6-Book Collection Set: Old Man''s War, the Ghost Brigades, the Last Colony, Zoe''s Tale, the Human Division, the End of All Things, by John Scalzi", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=Idz60QEACAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 0, "printType": "BOOK", "categories": ["Fiction"], "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=Idz60QEACAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=3&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2025-08-19", "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Old_Man_s_War_Series_6_Book_Collection_S.html?hl=&id=Idz60QEACAAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9798897220144"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "w3ouwTZDQZgC", "etag": "+2zgE6B+HQE", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/w3ouwTZDQZgC", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=w3ouwTZDQZgC&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "The novel&#39;s tone is right on target, too--sentimentality balanced by hardheaded calculation, know-it-all smugness moderated by innocent wonder."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Ghost Brigades", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=w3ouwTZDQZgC&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 356, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Pan Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=w3ouwTZDQZgC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=w3ouwTZDQZgC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "They are the special wing of the Colonial Defence Forces, elite troops created from DNA of the dead and turned into the perfect soldiers for the CDF’s toughest operations. The universe is a dangerous place for humanity, as three hostile races combine to halt our further expansion into space. Their linchpin is a turncoat scientist, Charles Boutin, who unfortunately knows the CDF’s biggest military secrets. And to prevail against this alliance, they must find out why Boutin did what he did. Jared Dirac is the only human able to provide answers, being a superhuman hybrid created form Boutin’s own DNA. Jared’s brain should therefore be able to access Boutin’s electronic memories . . . but when that appears to fail, Jared is instead passed on to the Ghost Brigades. Then, just as time is running out, Boutin’s memories slowly begin to surface within him . . . but all this while the enemy is planning something much worse for mankind than just military defeat. Praise for Old Man’s War: ‘Clever dialogue, fast-paced story and strong characters.’ The Times ‘An original idea, which is brilliantly executed’ Sc-Fi Now", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=w3ouwTZDQZgC&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=4&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2008", "contentVersion": "1.4.6.0.preview.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Ghost_Brigades.html?hl=&id=w3ouwTZDQZgC", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "0330457101"}, {"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9780330457101"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "YWzFDAAAQBAJ", "etag": "wbK18AfQyqk", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/YWzFDAAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=YWzFDAAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "The universe is a hostile place in John Scalzi&#39;s The End of All Things the sixth in The Old Man&#39;s War series."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The End of All Things", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=YWzFDAAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 384, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Pan Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=YWzFDAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=YWzFDAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "Colonial Defense Forces Lieutenant Harry Wilson investigates a series of alien attacks that are threatening Earth''s survivors and an increasingly under-sourced Colonial Union.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=YWzFDAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=5&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2016-06-16", "contentVersion": "0.6.2.0.preview.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_End_of_All_Things.html?hl=&id=YWzFDAAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781447290506"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "144729050X"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "cXQ4EQAAQBAJ", "etag": "1ZZFtF2rtbI", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 5990000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 5990000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&rdid=book-cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 5.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 5.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/cXQ4EQAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true, "acsTokenLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books/download/The_Shattering_Peace-sample-epub.acsm?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&format=epub&output=acs4_fulfillment_token&dl_type=sample&source=gbs_api"}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Gretchen Trujillo is used to the monotony of work within the Colonial Union’s bureaucracy. But her mundane life ends the moment she’s recruited for a secret mission, where she’s joined by envoys from every powerful faction in space."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Shattering Peace", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "The acclaimed Old Man''s War series returns in this military sci-fi adventure", "pageCount": 270, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Pan Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "The truce is over. But has the end begun? An unmissable return to the critically-acclaimed Old Man’s War series, from Hugo Award-winner and science fiction master John Scalzi. For ten years a fragile truce has held between the Colonial Union, Earth and the alien Conclave. But the Consu, the most advanced species in the galaxy, are descending into a civil war that threatens to touch every living soul in interstellar space. Gretchen Trujillo is used to the monotony of work within the Colonial Union’s bureaucracy. But her mundane life ends the moment she’s recruited for a secret mission, where she’s joined by envoys from every powerful faction in space. Gretchen must navigate a web of alien intrigue to uncover a truth that will reshape the destiny of every known species, or erase humans and aliens from the stars forever. * * * Praise for the Old Man''s War series ‘John Scalzi is the most entertaining, accessible writer working in SF today’ – Joe Hill, author of King Sorrow ‘Scalzi is one of the slickest writers that SF has ever produced’ – Wall Street Journal ‘It gladdens the reader''s heart . . . great fun’ – Daily Telegraph", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=6&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2025-09-18", "contentVersion": "1.2.2.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=cXQ4EQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781509835409"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1509835407"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "fKhjEQAAQBAJ", "etag": "Nu7Np7UDooU", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 120000000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 120000000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ&rdid=book-fKhjEQAAQBAJ&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 120, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 120, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/fKhjEQAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": true}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "... Old. Man&#39;s. War. Series. Under Heinlein&#39;s Shadow: Lessons and Disagreements John <b>Scalzi</b> (b. 1969, Fairfield, California) has accumulated a good number of awards and nominations, beginning with the 2005 ... <b>Scalzi&#39;s Old Man&#39;s War</b> Series."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Masculinity in Contemporary Science Fiction by Men", "authors": ["Sara Martín"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "No Plans for the Future", "pageCount": 145, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Liverpool University Press", "categories": ["Literary Criticism"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "Masculinity in Contemporary Science Fiction by Men: No Plans for the Future is the first comprehensive study of the self-representation of men in SF novels published in the twenty-first century by male authors. Exploring a broad selection of writers and works, the fourteen chapters present a panoramic overview of men’s contributions to current SF and explore their slow but noticeable progress in the representation of gender. The impact of feminism and gender studies, and the demands of readers, have profoundly transformed men’s SF, which now presents far more caring and vulnerable male characters. The old stereotypes are being replaced by a collective reflection on how men and masculinity are changing, though the lack of a common agenda results in novels that, while exciting and often challenging, sometimes miss the chance to imagine a better, anti-patriarchal, pro-feminist future for men and for all human beings. The authors analysed include Robert Charles Wilson, Geoff Ryman, Samuel R. Delany, Richard K. Morgan, John Scalzi, Iain M. Banks, Ernest Cline, James S.A. Corey, Colson Whitehead, Andy Weir, Daniel H. Wilson, Ian McDonald, Yoon Ha Lee, Tade Thompson, Neal Stephenson and Kim Stanley Robinson.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ&pg=PA318&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=7&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": true}, "publishedDate": "2025-05-30", "contentVersion": "1.1.1.0.preview.3", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=fKhjEQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781836249658"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1836249659"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "zlEKEQAAQBAJ", "etag": "EgmJ7meTIfA", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/zlEKEQAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=zlEKEQAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "The highly-anticipated conclusion to the science fiction trilogy begun with Old Man&#39;s War and The Ghost Brigades."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Last Colony", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=zlEKEQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 0, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Tor Books", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=zlEKEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=zlEKEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "The highly-anticipated conclusion to the science fiction trilogy begun with Old Man''s War and The Ghost Brigades.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=zlEKEQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=8&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2025-02-25", "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Last_Colony.html?hl=&id=zlEKEQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781250359537"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1250359538"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "AvQQ0QEACAAJ", "etag": "Np4hqaAwtQM", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/AvQQ0QEACAAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=AvQQ0QEACAAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Old Man''s War Series 1-6", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=AvQQ0QEACAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 0, "printType": "BOOK", "categories": ["Fiction"], "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=AvQQ0QEACAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=9&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2016-05-31", "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Old_Man_s_War_Series_1_6.html?hl=&id=AvQQ0QEACAAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9798897224692"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "Gtg9EAAAQBAJ", "etag": "25UZCXkxiqE", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 19990000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 19990000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&rdid=book-Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 19.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 19.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/Gtg9EAAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": true, "acsTokenLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books/download/To_Boldly_Go-sample-pdf.acsm?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&format=pdf&output=acs4_fulfillment_token&dl_type=sample&source=gbs_api"}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true, "acsTokenLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books/download/To_Boldly_Go-sample-epub.acsm?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&format=epub&output=acs4_fulfillment_token&dl_type=sample&source=gbs_api"}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "... <b>Scalzi</b>, <b>Old Man&#39;s War</b>: Book 1 (New York: Tor Books, 2005), 5. 2 John <b>Scalzi</b>, “<b>Old Man&#39;s War</b>: Ten Years On,” Whatever, Jan 1, 2015. Source: https://whatever. <b>scalzi</b>.com/2015/01/01/<b>old</b>-<b>mans</b>-<b>war</b>-ten-years-on/. 3 Hew Strachan, Clausewitz&#39;s On&nbsp;..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "To Boldly Go", "authors": ["Jonathan Klug", "Steven Leonard"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "Leadership, Strategy, and Conflict in the 21st Century and Beyond", "pageCount": 305, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Casemate", "categories": ["Social Science"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "\"A rich exploration of sci-fi universes we know and love, merged flawlessly with discussions on leadership, national security . . . diplomacy, and more.\" — Diplomatic Courier As a literature of ideas, science fiction has proven to be a powerful metaphor for the world around us, offering a rich tapestry of imagination through which to explore how we lead, how we think, and how we interact. To Boldly Go assembles more than thirty writers from around the world—experts in leadership and strategy, senior policy advisors and analysts, professional educators and innovators, experienced storytellers, and ground-level military leaders—to help us better understand ourselves through the lens of science fiction Each chapter of To Boldly Go draws out the lessons that we can learn from science fiction, drawing on classic examples of the genre in ways that are equally relatable and entertaining. A chapter on the burdens of leadership by Ghost Fleet author August Cole launches readers into the cosmos with Captain Avatar aboard the space battleship Yamato. In another chapter, the climactic Battle of the Mutara Nebula from The Wrath of Khan weighs the advantages of experience over intelligence in the pursuit of strategy. What does inter-species conflict in science fiction tell us about our perspectives on social Darwinism? Whether using Star Trek: Deep Space Nine to explore the nuances of maritime strategy or The Expanse to better understand the threat posed by depleted natural resources, To Boldly Go provides thoughtful essays on relevant subjects that will appeal to business leaders, military professionals, and fans of science fiction alike.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ&pg=PA84&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=10&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": true}, "publishedDate": "2021-09-30", "contentVersion": "1.6.6.0.preview.3", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=Gtg9EAAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781636240633"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1636240631"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "NEGmDQAAQBAJ", "etag": "w2vF99yrRhw", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/NEGmDQAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": true}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=NEGmDQAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Old Man&#39;s War Series #1 Old Man’s War #2 The Ghost Brigades #3 The Last Colony #4 Zoe’s Tale #5 The Human Division #6 The End of All Things Short fiction: “After the Coup” Other Tor Books The Android’s Dream Agent to the Stars ..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Old Man''s War Series", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=NEGmDQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "(Old Man''s War, The Ghost Brigades, The Last Colony, Zoe''s Tale, The Human Division, The End of All Things)", "pageCount": 2817, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Tor Books", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=NEGmDQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=NEGmDQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "This discounted ebundle includes: Old Man''s War, The Ghost Brigades, The Last Colony, Zoe’s Tale, The Human Division, The End of All Things New York Times bestselling author John Scalzi takes you on an epic romp of galactic conquest and exploration, with some laughs along the way. \"Gripping and surpassingly original.\" —Cory Doctorow Earth itself is a backwater. The bulk of humanity''s resources are in the hands of the Colonial Defense Force, which shields the home planet from too much knowledge of the situation. What''s known to everybody is that when you reach retirement age, you can join the CDF. They don''t want young people; they want people who carry the knowledge and skills of decades of living. You''ll be taken off Earth and never allowed to return. You''ll serve your time at the front. And if you survive, you''ll be given a generous homestead stake of your own, on one of our hard-won colony planets. Old Man’s War — John Perry did two things on his 75th birthday. First he visited his wife''s grave. Then he joined the army, with only the vaguest idea what to expect. Because the actual fight is far more difficult than he can imagine—and what he will become is far stranger. The Ghost Brigades — At first, Jared is a perfect soldier, but as another man''s memories slowly surface, Jared begins to intuit the reasons for their betrayal. Time is running out: The alliance is preparing its offensive, and some of them plan worse things than humanity''s mere military defeat. The Last Colony — Retired from his fighting days, John Perry and his wife, Jane, are pulled back into the political arena, and into the thick of interstellar politics, betrayal, and war. Zoe’s Tale — Zoe Boutin Perry: A colonist stranded on a deadly pioneer world. Holy icon to a race of aliens. A player (and a pawn) in an interstellar chess match to save humanity, or to see it fall. Witness to history. Friend. Daughter. Human. Seventeen years old. The Human Division — The CU''s secrets are known to all. Other alien races have come on the scene and formed a new alliance—an alliance against the Colonial Union. And they''ve invited the people of Earth to join them. For a shaken and betrayed Earth, the choice isn''t obvious or easy. The End of All Things — CDF Lieutenant Harry Wilson and the Colonial Union diplomats he works with race against the clock to discover who is behind attacks on the Union and on alien races, to seek peace with a suspicious, angry Earth, and keep humanity''s union intact...or else risk oblivion, and extinction—and the end of all things. Old Man''s War Series #1 Old Man’s War #2 The Ghost Brigades #3 The Last Colony #4 Zoe’s Tale #5 The Human Division #6 The End of All Things Short fiction: “After the Coup” Other Tor Books The Android’s Dream Agent to the Stars Your Hate Mail Will Be Graded Fuzzy Nation Redshirts Lock In At the Publisher''s request, this title is being sold without Digital Rights Management Software (DRM) applied.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=NEGmDQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=11&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2016-12-27", "contentVersion": "1.19.17.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Old_Man_s_War_Series.html?hl=&id=NEGmDQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9780765396761"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "0765396769"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "0GzFDAAAQBAJ", "etag": "pBd7hcYNXHk", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/0GzFDAAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=0GzFDAAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Hard-core science fiction at its very best, John Scalzi&#39;s The Human Division is the fifth in The Old Man&#39;s War series."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Human Division", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=0GzFDAAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 513, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Pan Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=0GzFDAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=0GzFDAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "B Team leader Lieutenant Harry Wilson counters hostile alien forces, angry humans and unpredictable elements from the universe in order to protect the interests of the Colonial Union.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=0GzFDAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=12&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2016", "contentVersion": "0.7.2.0.preview.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Human_Division.html?hl=&id=0GzFDAAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781447290476"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "144729047X"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "6FImJudzl_UC", "etag": "2gHwe/fXg1k", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 4990000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 4990000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=6FImJudzl_UC&rdid=book-6FImJudzl_UC&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 4.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 4.99, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/6FImJudzl_UC", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=6FImJudzl_UC&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Zoë must become a player (and a pawn) in an interstellar battle, which will determine the fate of humanity. Her father&#39;s side of this story was told in The Last Colony, but Zoe&#39;s Tale reveals a whole new dimension."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Zoe''s Tale", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=6FImJudzl_UC&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "Military Science Fiction Adventure", "pageCount": 327, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Pan Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=6FImJudzl_UC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=6FImJudzl_UC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "Hard-core, fast paced science fiction, John Scalzi''s Zoe''s Tale is the fourth in The Old Man''s War series. She won''t go down without a fight. It''s not every day you up sticks and move to another world. But then, Zoë Boutin-Perry''s life has never been ordinary. She''s the adopted teenage daughter of two former super-soldiers. She''s also a holy icon to a race of alien warriors who track her every move. So she''s used to the quirks of being a human in space. However, this time something''s different. Betrayed by the authorities, Zoë – along with her parents and fellow colonists - finds herself stranded on a deadly pioneer planet. The Colonial Union has also set them up as a target for hostile alien action. Zoë must become a player (and a pawn) in an interstellar battle, which will determine the fate of humanity. Her father''s side of this story was told in The Last Colony, but Zoe''s Tale reveals a whole new dimension. It''s a story you may think you know, but you don''t really know it at all. Continue the gripping space war series with The Human Division. ''John Scalzi is the most entertaining, accessible writer working in SF today'' – Joe Hill, author of The Fireman", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=6FImJudzl_UC&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=13&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2011-02-23", "contentVersion": "4.9.10.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=6FImJudzl_UC", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9780330507387"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "0330507389"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "9hI4EQAAQBAJ", "etag": "XNgbwxMDQC4", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 10030000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 10030000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ&rdid=book-9hI4EQAAQBAJ&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 10.03, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 10.03, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/9hI4EQAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "OTHER TOR BOOKS BY JOHN SCALZI Agent to the Stars The Android’s Dream Fuzzy Nation Redshirts Your Hate Mail Will Be Graded: A Decade of Whatever, 1998–2008 The Kaiju Preservation Society Starter Villain When the Moon Hits Your Eye ..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Shattering Peace", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "Old Man''s War Book 7", "pageCount": 232, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Tor Books", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "After a decade, acclaimed science fiction master John Scalzi returns to the galaxy of the Old Man''s War series with the long awaited seventh book, The Shattering Peace THE PEACE IS SHATTERING For a decade, peace has reigned in interstellar space. A tripartite agreement between the Colonial Union, the Earth, and the alien Conclave has kept the forces of war at bay, even when some would have preferred to return to the fighting and struggle of former times. For now, more sensible heads have prevailed – and have even championed unity. But now, there is a new force that threatens the hard-maintained peace: The Consu, the most advanced intelligent species humans have ever met, are on the cusp of a species-defining civil war. This war is between Consu factions... but nothing the Consu ever do is just about them. The Colonial Union, the Earth and the Conclave have been unwillingly dragged into the conflict, in the most surprising of ways. Gretchen Trujillo is a mid-level diplomat, working in an unimportant part of the Colonial Union bureaucracy. But when she is called to take part in a secret mission involving representatives from every powerful faction in space, what she finds there has the chance to redefine the destinies of humans and aliens alike... or destroy them forever. OTHER TOR BOOKS BY JOHN SCALZI Agent to the Stars The Android’s Dream Fuzzy Nation Redshirts Your Hate Mail Will Be Graded: A Decade of Whatever, 1998–2008 The Kaiju Preservation Society Starter Villain When the Moon Hits Your Eye Monsters of Ohio THE OLD MAN’S WAR NOVELS Old Man’s War The Ghost Brigades The Last Colony Zoë’s Tale The Human Division The End of All Things THE LOCK IN SERIES Lock In Head On Unlocked THE INTERDEPENDENCY SEQUENCE The Collapsing Empire The Consuming Fire The Last Emperox EDITED BY JOHN SCALZI Metatropolis At the Publisher''s request, this title is being sold without Digital Rights Management Software (DRM) applied.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=14&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2025-09-16", "contentVersion": "1.5.5.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=9hI4EQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9780765389206"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "0765389207"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "aDp9_ciDy5kC", "etag": "cx3C0/H9gzY", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/aDp9_ciDy5kC", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": true}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=aDp9_ciDy5kC&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Hard-core science fiction at its very best, the sequel to his extraordinary Old Man&#39;s War They are the special wing of the Colonial Defence Forces, elite troops created from DNA of the dead and turned into the perfect soldiers for the CDF&#39;s ..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Ghost Brigades: Old Man''s War Book 2", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=aDp9_ciDy5kC&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 318, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Tor UK", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=aDp9_ciDy5kC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=aDp9_ciDy5kC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "Hard-core science fiction at its very best, the sequel to his extraordinary Old Man''s War They are the special wing of the Colonial Defence Forces, elite troops created from DNA of the dead and turned into the perfect soldiers for the CDF''s toughest operations. The universe is a dangerous place for humanity, as three hostile races combine to halt our further expansion into space. Their linchpin is a turncoat scientist, Charles Boutin, who unfortunately knows the CDF''s biggest military secrets. And to prevail against this alliance, they must find out why Boutin did what he did. Jared Dirac is the only human able to provide answers, being a superhuman hybrid created form Boutin''s own DNA. Jared''s brain should therefore be able to access Boutin''s electronic memories ... but when that appears to fail, Jared is instead passed on to the Ghost Brigades. Then, just as time is running out, Boutin''s memories slowly begin to surface within him ... but all this while the enemy is planning something much worse for mankind than just military defeat. PRAISE FOR THE OLD MAN''S WAR SERIES \"Clever dialogue, fast-paced story and strong characters.\" The Times \"Great fun\" Daily Telegraph", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=aDp9_ciDy5kC&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=15&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2008-02-01", "contentVersion": "1.16.15.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Ghost_Brigades_Old_Man_s_War_Book_2.html?hl=&id=aDp9_ciDy5kC", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781743285770"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1743285779"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "ilny0QEACAAJ", "etag": "mIMKikj9psw", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/ilny0QEACAAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=ilny0QEACAAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "“The” Old Man''s War Series", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=ilny0QEACAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 0, "printType": "BOOK", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=ilny0QEACAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=16&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2024", "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Old_Man_s_War_Series.html?hl=&id=ilny0QEACAAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "OTHER", "identifier": "OCLC:1581516974"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "vB9jDwAAQBAJ", "etag": "h/hCU7lmW1U", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"offers": [{"giftable": true, "listPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 8670000}, "retailPrice": {"currencyCode": "GBP", "amountInMicros": 8670000}, "finskyOfferType": 1}], "buyLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&rdid=book-vB9jDwAAQBAJ&rdot=1&source=gbs_api", "country": "GB", "isEbook": true, "listPrice": {"amount": 8.67, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "retailPrice": {"amount": 8.67, "currencyCode": "GBP"}, "saleability": "FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/vB9jDwAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true, "acsTokenLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books/download/The_Fire_in_Fiction-sample-epub.acsm?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&format=epub&output=acs4_fulfillment_token&dl_type=sample&source=gbs_api"}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "... War has been portrayed in countless works of fiction such as Ste- phen Crane&#39;s The Red Badge of Courage ( 1895 ) ... <b>Scalzi&#39;s Old Man&#39;s War</b> ( 2005 ) , which posits a future in which old folks don&#39;t have to die , they can instead&nbsp;..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Fire in Fiction", "authors": ["Donald Maass"], "infoLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "subtitle": "Passion, Purpose and Techniques to Make Your Novel Great", "pageCount": 273, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Penguin", "categories": ["Language Arts & Disciplines"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "Discover the Difference Between a So-So Manuscript and a Novel Readers Can''t Forget We''ve all read them: novels by our favorite authors that disappoint. Uninspired and lifeless, we wonder what happened. Was the author in a hurry? Did she have a bad year? Has he lost interest altogether? Something similar is true of a great many unpublished manuscripts. They are okay stories that never take flight. They don''t grip the imagination, let alone the heart. They merit only a shrug and a polite dismissal by agents and editors. It doesn''t have to be that way. In The Fire in Fiction, successful literary agent and author Donald Maass shows you not only how to infuse your story with deep conviction and fiery passion, but how to do it over and over again. The book features: • Techniques for capturing a special time and place, creating characters whose lives matter, nailing multiple-impact plot turns, making the supernatural real, infusing issues into fiction, and more. • Story-enriching exercises at the end of every chapter to show you how to apply the practical tools just covered to your own work. • Rich examples drawn from contemporary novels as diverse as The Lake House, Water for Elephants, and Jennifer Government to illustrate how various techniques work in actual stories. Plus, Maass introduces an original technique that any novelist can use any time, in any scene, in any novel, even on the most uninspired day...to take the most powerful experiences from your personal life and turn those experiences directly into powerful fiction. Tap into The Fire in Fiction, and supercharge your story with originality and spark!", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA246&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=17&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2009-04-08", "contentVersion": "1.4.4.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=vB9jDwAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781582979878"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1582979871"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "-T46AQAAIAAJ", "etag": "glpFsIaDt9M", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/-T46AQAAIAAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=-T46AQAAIAAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "... war . &quot; John <b>Scalzi</b> is a fresh and appealing new voice , and <b>Old Man&#39;s War</b> is classic SF seen from a modern perspective . &quot; -Robert Charles Wilson 0-7653-1697-8 HARDCOVER Visit our brand - new website ! TOR ALSO AVAILABLE The war&nbsp;..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "The Magazine of Fantasy & Science Fiction", "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=-T46AQAAIAAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 506, "printType": "BOOK", "categories": ["Fantasy fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=-T46AQAAIAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=-T46AQAAIAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api"}, "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=-T46AQAAIAAJ&q=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=18&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2007-04", "contentVersion": "0.4.1.0.preview.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Magazine_of_Fantasy_Science_Fiction.html?hl=&id=-T46AQAAIAAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "OTHER", "identifier": "STANFORD:36105123022068"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "0lEKEQAAQBAJ", "etag": "aXp7bzEBrsM", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/0lEKEQAAQBAJ", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": false, "viewability": "NO_PAGES", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=0lEKEQAAQBAJ&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "NONE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Zoe Boutin Perry is a colonist stranded on a deadly pioneer world. Holy icon to a race of aliens. A player and a pawn in an interstellar chess match to save humanity, or to see it fall."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Zoe''s Tale", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=0lEKEQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 0, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Tor Books", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=0lEKEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=0lEKEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "A return to the bestselling Old Man''s War universe, by science fiction''s fastest-rising new star, told from the point of view of one of the most appealing characters in the series!", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=0lEKEQAAQBAJ&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=19&source=gbs_api", "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "publishedDate": "2025-02-25", "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Zoe_s_Tale.html?hl=&id=0lEKEQAAQBAJ", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781250359520"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "125035952X"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}, {"id": "2fuUMNAW34QC", "etag": "PAP+j2O7HOI", "kind": "books#volume", "saleInfo": {"country": "GB", "isEbook": false, "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE"}, "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/2fuUMNAW34QC", "accessInfo": {"pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "epub": {"isAvailable": true}, "country": "GB", "embeddable": true, "viewability": "PARTIAL", "publicDomain": false, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=2fuUMNAW34QC&hl=&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "From New York Times bestseller and Hugo Award-winner John Scalzi, an extraordinary retelling of the SF classic Little Fuzzy ZaraCorp holds the right to extract unlimited resources from the verdant planet Zarathustra—as long as the planet ..."}, "volumeInfo": {"title": "Fuzzy Nation", "authors": ["John Scalzi"], "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=2fuUMNAW34QC&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&source=gbs_api", "language": "en", "pageCount": 372, "printType": "BOOK", "publisher": "Macmillan", "categories": ["Fiction"], "imageLinks": {"thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=2fuUMNAW34QC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=2fuUMNAW34QC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "description": "From New York Times bestseller and Hugo Award-winner John Scalzi, an extraordinary retelling of the SF classic Little Fuzzy ZaraCorp holds the right to extract unlimited resources from the verdant planet Zarathustra—as long as the planet is certifiably free of native sentients. So when an outback prospector discovers a species of small, appealing bipeds who might well turn out to be intelligent, language-using beings, it''s a race to stop the corporation from \"eliminating the problem,\" which is to say, eliminating the Fuzzies—wide-eyed and ridiculously cute small, and furry—who are as much people as we are. Other Tor Books The Android’s Dream Agent to the Stars Your Hate Mail Will Be Graded Fuzzy Nation Redshirts 1. Lock In 2. Head On The Interdepency Sequence 1. The Collapsing Empire 2. The Consuming Fire Old Man''s War Series 1. Old Man’s War 2. The Ghost Brigades 3. The Last Colony 4. Zoe’s Tale 5. The Human Division 6. The End of All Things At the Publisher''s request, this title is being sold without Digital Rights Management Software (DRM) applied.", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=2fuUMNAW34QC&printsec=frontcover&dq=Old+Man%27s+War+Scalzi&hl=&cd=20&source=gbs_api", "ratingsCount": 6, "readingModes": {"text": true, "image": false}, "averageRating": 4, "publishedDate": "2011-05-10", "contentVersion": "5.24.21.0.preview.2", "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": true, "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Fuzzy_Nation.html?hl=&id=2fuUMNAW34QC", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9781429924443"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "1429924446"}], "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}}}], "totalItems": 300}', '2026-09-08 20:02:34.140869');
